Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL DARWIN PATCH] gambit: closed-set reuse at the link consumer

Apply after experimental 0024 and 0025. Removes all singleton producer hooks
from the CLI; the old producer files are no longer included. Only Darwin with
GAMBIT_DARWIN_CLOSED_LINK_REUSE=1 and explicit -closed-c-binding is eligible.
Preserves mixed input order, preload flags and default link output location.
Whole-consumer performance admission and production AOT integration pending.

